Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
World Breaker
Mox Ruby
Shock
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Island
Wind Drake
Mox Ruby
Shock
Island x20

[Actions]
? Bot1.Hand.World Breaker.Colors =
